{{define "content"}}<article class="security-thanks-page">
<h1>Security Acknowledgments</h1>

{{if .Thanks}}
<p>Thank you to the researchers below, who reported issues responsibly and
agreed to be credited.</p>
<ul class="security-thanks-list">
{{range .Thanks}}<li><strong>{{.Name}}</strong>{{if .Year}} &mdash; {{.Year}}{{end}}{{if .Credit}}: {{.Credit}}{{end}}</li>
{{end}}</ul>
{{else}}
<p>No acknowledgments have been published yet. Researchers who report an
issue and ask to be credited will be listed here once the issue is
disclosed.</p>
{{end}}

<p><a href="/server/security">Back to security</a></p>
</article>
{{end}}
